  <item>
    <title>EP17 中国思想家这么多，凭啥王阳明这么火？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/638e0653918714f50b644643</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">638e0653918714f50b644643</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 05 Dec 2022 14:55:15 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fq1nIfpwAgrYeF8WD4YmZddb_l0u.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>【shownotes】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="59">00:59</a> 王阳明为什么这么火？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="207">03:27</a> 王阳明的完美形象是如何塑造起来的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="593">09:53</a> 要获得影响力，古代思想家从祀孔庙才能真正有影响力。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="846">14:06</a> 王阳明批评朱熹到底在哪几个方面？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1089">18:09</a> 王阳明取得这么大成就，与家庭背景、早年经历有很大关系。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1251">20:51</a> 历史上的王阳明与今天我们所相信的王阳明可能也不一样</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1424">23:44</a> 王阳明对世界也有影响，引发了日本明治维新？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1688">28:08</a> 身后影响力，得靠弟子推动和大量刊印书籍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1949">32:29</a> 王阳明的传奇色彩也造就了其影响力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2228">37:08</a> 王阳明的理论特色主要走在民间，也是其影响力大的根源</span></p><span></span><p><span>【出品】</span></p><span></span><p><span>雪尘文化</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ltSX3EMUprvNrBowSUZvzOP_Sa0r.m4a" length="38964915" type="audio/mp4"/>
