  <item>
    <title>EP15《老子》是一本奇书吗？我认为不是</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6344147b2a992d56e91e5c0b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6344147b2a992d56e91e5c0b</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 10 Oct 2022 12:47:55 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrxOJnDqHjgffMXDx0kT6tC7yZje.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>[shownotes]</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="49">00:49</a> 老子到底是一个什么人？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="307">05:07</a> 关于老子的相关传说，在司马迁的西汉时代已经存在</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="436">07:16</a> 古代的《老子》文本和我们今天通常看到的有什么不一样？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="725">12:05</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;出土文献四种《老子》对于我们看待《老子》有什么意义？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1068">17:48</a> 对于各版本《老子》，我们持开放的文本观念</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1345">22:25</a> 《老子》的核心思想是无为与自然，并且主要是对统治者和君说的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1757">29:17</a> 老庄有什么样的异同</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2068">34:28</a> &nbsp;儒道的关系也许并不对立</span></p><span></span><p><span>[出品]</span></p><span></span><p><span>雪尘文化</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lkQvL5X7J7yr_6M-8fSjz67AC1kZ.m4a" length="39612371" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:40:46</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fnu8KvgeNRUxuIPjYZUOKHlvJwYE.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>EP14 一辆自行车16万元，奢侈品到底贵在哪儿？什么人在买单？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/632eeee2e67030aadb38e3d2</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">632eeee2e67030aadb38e3d2</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 24 Sep 2022 11:49:53 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FilnVXaZ3HMGtjhe_4sHjb1dTcQ_.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>【shownotes】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="195">3:15</a> “luxury”（奢侈）相对应的拉丁文接近英文单词 “delicate”（精美的），它包含“浪费的”意思</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="302">5:02</a> “真实的稀缺性”是奢侈品的特性之一</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="517">8:37</a> 顶奢品牌、中奢品牌、轻奢品牌之分</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="677">11:17</a> 奢侈品牌中的所谓“配货”是什么情况？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1030">17:10</a> 奢侈品销售经常呈现“卖方市场”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1176">19:36</a>奢侈品价值建立的根基</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1442">24:02</a> 代言人的形象就是奢侈品牌设定的客户群体形象</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1736">28:56</a> 奢侈品牌的定价逻辑是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1990">33:10</a> 奢侈品真的具有保值或者投资的功能吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2180">36:20</a> “离奇”的客户故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2360">39:20</a> 奢侈品消费者日渐低龄化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2540">42:20</a> 普金穿的顶级低调奢侈品羊毛衫</span></p><span></span><p><span>【出品】</span></p><span></span><p><span>雪尘文化</span></p>]]></description>
