  </item>
  <item>
    <title>EP13 欲望越低越幸福？听听海归翻译的躺平生活</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63022e1c2427ab3f84afad2b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">63022e1c2427ab3f84afad2b</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 21 Aug 2022 13:07:40 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpnfuJnUUSvHfDwZ4v_00krHqaOd.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>【shownotes】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="267">04:27</a> 三次考研失败，备受打击，身体无法承受之累</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="487">08:07</a> 为爱决定出国深造，结果恋爱失败，还是决定为了自己出国深造</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="838">13:58</a> 躺平需要资本，人生轨迹可以总结为：偶尔奋发，经常躺平</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1283">21:23</a> 自由译者的定义</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1529">25:29</a> &nbsp;FIRE式生活：financial independent, retiringearly</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1974">32:54</a> 有盼头的累，不叫累</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2436">40:36</a> 躺平也是一种理性，是从日常社会生活中逃脱出来进入另外一个平行空间</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2626">43:46</a> 内驱力：知之者不如乐之者，乐之者不如好之者</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3034">50:34</a> 玩游戏也是暂时摆脱外在现实生活的一些功利与束缚</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3138">52:18</a> 认清自己，再去选择</span></p><span></span><p><span>【出品】</span></p><span></span><p><span>雪尘文化</span></p>]]></description>
