    <guid isPermaLink="false">62c57d8bedabcc8f59c02a0a</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 06 Jul 2022 12:18:19 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image-qiniu.jellow.site/FrrM3vv2K5Q3qjk_9xhyu7tMO71T.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>【shownotes】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="90">01:30</a> 怎么看2022年全国高考“本手、俗手、妙手”那道作文题？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="553">09:13</a> 红楼梦那道题到底在考什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="821">13:41</a> 高考作文题给的材料不是关键，材料下面的注解是关键</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1056">17:36</a> 如果聚焦在给匾额题名这件事，就离题了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1491">24:51</a> 现在高中语文的训练如何提高作文能力？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1644">27:24</a> 阅读量是否为写好作文的关键</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1915">31:55</a> 中学阶段阅读经典名著的必要性还有吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2402">40:02</a> 经典名著中的“尺度”问题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2880">48:00</a> 经典阅读起到“支援意识”的作用</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2950">49:10</a> 红楼梦这类经典是否离我们的生活很远？</span></p><span></span><p><span>【出品】</span></p><span></span><p><span>雪尘文化</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lriSOmEsA52dCEGZIvLROUPl_RMp.m4a" length="77941198" type="audio/mp4"/>
